<title>ESTONIA: BALTIKA AND VIISNURK LISTED ON TALLINN BOURSE.</title>
<headline>BALTIKA AND VIISNURK LISTED ON TALLINN BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinn stock exchange decided on Thursday to accept ski maker Viisnurk and the Baltika clothing maker and retailer as new listings from June 5.</p>
<p>Baltika will have 4.8 million kroons of shares listed on the main list of the stock exchange, the Stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Viisnurk will have 633,860 shares traded on the secondary list, it added.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
